# NOTE: .env is intentionally tracked — it holds ONLY publishable
# client-side keys (Supabase publishable key, Maps browser key) that
# ship in the JS bundle anyway. Real secrets go in *.local files,
# which are ignored above. Restrict the Maps key by domain in Google
# Cloud Console rather than treating it as a secret.
